From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:58:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Upgrade direct dependencies to their latest releases

Raise every direct dependency requirement to its latest stable release under Rust 1.99.1 and adapt Codex to the new APIs: rand 0.10, digest 0.11, hmac 0.13, p256 0.14, reqwest 0.13, tokio 1.54, ctor 1, vt100 0.18, tree-sitter 0.27, whoami 2, base64 0.23, zbus 6 and others. serde_yaml, which is deprecated, is replaced with serde_norway (the YAML patch later moves to serde-saphyr); schemars moves from 0.8 to 1 and ts-rs from 11 to 12, keeping schemars 0.8's published schema names, single-value enums and shapes where generated clients depend on them. secret-service stays on keyring 3.6's release and sse-stream on the 0.2 series that rmcp requires.
